This  section  describes  the standard interface to configuration
and status information on IEEE 802.11 devices.  Most devices sup‐
port options not configurable by this interface.   They  must  be
set by their respective, specific control program.  The interface
is  via one of the following calls on a socket: Get configuration
or status information.  Set configuration information.  These re‐
quests are made via a modified structure.  This structure is  de‐
fined       as      follows:      struct      ieee80211req      {
